<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμ-άδιον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>large stone,
				boulder,</i> such as were used for missiles by the heroes of
			the <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκριόεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.518
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.265
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.410
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δὲ χερμάδιον λάβε χειρὶ . . , μέγα
					ἔργον, ὃ οὐ δύο γ᾽ ἄνδρε φέροιεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.302
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				20.285
			</span></i>; twice in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδραχθέσι χερμαδίοισι
			βάλλον,</span> of the Laestrygones, <i><span class="en">
				10.121
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21.371
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				38.6
			</span></i>.—Not a 
				Dim. of
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάς,</span> but neut. of an Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάδιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>of the shape</i> or <i>size of a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάς, μολύβδαιναι χερμάδιοι</span>
			leaden balls <i>for arm-exercises,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
